pter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-041-yue"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-041-yue:p001","quote":"越王句踐，其先禹之苗裔，而夏后帝少康之庶子也。封於會稽，以奉守禹之祀。文身斷髮，披草萊而邑焉。後二十餘世，至於允常。允常之時，與呉王闔廬戰而相怨伐。允常卒，子句踐立，是爲越王。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-041-yue:p028","quote":"太史公曰：禹之功大矣，漸九川，定九州，至于今諸夏艾安。及苗裔句踐，苦身焦思，終滅彊呉，北觀兵中國，以尊周室，號稱霸王。句踐可不謂賢哉！蓋有禹之遺烈焉。范蠡三遷皆有榮名，名垂後世。臣主若此，欲毋顯得乎！"}],"rationale":"限本篇明示姓名、短稱與同一事件角色；范蠡自謂鴟夷子皮、陶朱公按明文相接。跨篇僅使用另存同指決定，不按同名合併；匿名楚王不套用楚威王，未知諸子姓名不補。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:p001","text":"越王句踐，其先禹之苗裔，而夏后帝少康之庶子也。封於會稽，以奉守禹之祀。文身斷髮，披草萊而邑焉。後二十餘世，至於允常。允常之時，與呉王闔廬戰而相怨伐。允常卒，子句踐立，是爲越王。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"越王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002055","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"句踐","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002055","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0007","start":7,"end":8,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002056","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0013","start":13,"end":18,"surface":"夏后帝少康","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002057","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"庶子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名、群體、神祇或引語用稱待覆核；不補姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0031","start":31,"end":32,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002056","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"允常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002058","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0058","start":58,"end":60,"surface":"允常","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002058","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-041-yue:m001-0064","start":64,"end":68,"surface":"呉